# pinned.list - the dock's pinned applications, one .desktop id (the filename
# without ".desktop") per line, in dock order, maximum 8.
#
# xxri-dock-pin owns it and rebuilds /usr/local/tce.icons from it (plus
# dot.wbar's header triple) on every change and at boot. While the desktop
# runs, use `xxri-dock-pin pin|unpin <id>` instead of editing it.
#
# The entries below are the default dock.
xxri-store
xxri-settings
xxri-file
aterm
xxri-browser
xxri-media
xxri-editor
xxri-power
